---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import NewsletterSignup from '../components/NewsletterSignup.astro';
---

<Layout title="Über mich" description="Ich bin Kevin, 20, aus Solingen. Hier erfährst du wer ich bin und warum ich das mache.">
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="page-header-inner">
      <span class="page-badge">Über mich</span>
      <h1 class="page-title">Wer ist hier unterwegs?</h1>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="about-wrap">
    <div class="about-inner">
      <div class="about-grid">

        <!-- PHOTO -->
        <div class="photo-wrap">
          <div class="photo-img-wrap">
            <img src="/images/kevin-about.jpeg" alt="Kevin Trepper in Lissabon" class="photo-img" />
            <div class="photo-location-badge">📍 Lissabon, Portugal</div>
          </div>

          <!-- KURZPROFIL -->
          <div class="quick-profile">
            <div class="qp-row">
              <span class="qp-label">Alter</span>
              <span class="qp-val" id="about-age">–</span>
            </div>
            <div class="qp-row">
              <span class="qp-label">Heimat</span>
              <span class="qp-val">Solingen, DE</span>
            </div>
            <div class="qp-row">
              <span class="qp-label">Erster Solotrip</span>
              <span class="qp-val">2023 · Gijón</span>
            </div>
            <div class="qp-row">
              <span class="qp-label">Abflug</span>
              <span class="qp-val qp-val--coral">9. Juni 2026</span>
            </div>
            <div class="qp-row">
              <span class="qp-label">Reisestil</span>
              <span class="qp-val">Spontan</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="photo-card-ig">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" ry="5"/><path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"/><line x1="17.5" y1="6.5" x2="17.51" y2="6.5"/></svg>
            <a href="https://instagram.com/kevin.ontour" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@kevin.ontour</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- TEXT -->
        <div class="about-text">
          <h2 class="about-name">Kevin Trepper</h2>

          <div class="about-body">
            <p>
              Ich bin Kevin, <span id="about-age-inline">20</span>, aus Solingen. 2023 Abitur gemacht. Schon während der Vorbereitung,
              kurz vor meiner mündlichen Spanischprüfung, bin ich spontan solo nach Gijón gefahren, um die Sprache direkt vor Ort zu üben.
              Erster Solotrip. Seitdem weiß ich: Es macht keinen Unterschied, ob ich alleine reise,
              mit Freunden oder mit der Familie. Hauptsache unterwegs.
            </p>
            <p>
              Nach dem Abi direkt Ausbildung im E-Commerce gestartet, in unter zwei Jahren abgeschlossen,
              danach Vollzeit gearbeitet und die begrenzte Urlaubszeit so gut wie möglich genutzt.
              Ende Mai 2026 läuft mein Vertrag aus. Ich hab mich entschieden, den Plan nicht weiterzuführen.
              Stattdessen der Traum, den ich schon nach dem Abi hatte: einfach mal mehrere Monate am Stück reisen,
              ohne Zeitlimit, ohne feste Pläne.
            </p>
            <p>
              Diese Seite ist mein Archiv dafür. Wo ich war, was ich erlebt hab, was sich lohnt.
              Für alle, die mitverfolgen wollen. Und für mich selbst, damit ich's nicht vergesse.
            </p>
          </div>

          <NewsletterSignup variant="inline" />

          <div class="about-cta">
            <a href="/route" class="btn-primary">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M2 12h20"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg>
              Route ansehen
            </a>
            <a href="/orte" class="btn-secondary">
              Alle Reiseberichte
            </a>
            <a href="https://instagram.com/kevin.ontour" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-ig">
              Instagram
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #FDF4FF 0%, #ffffff 60%);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem 3rem;
  }
  .page-header-inner { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }

  .page-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--purple-light);
    color: #6D28D9;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
    border-radius: 100px;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .page-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .about-wrap { padding: 3rem 1.5rem 5rem; }
  .about-inner {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 280px 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  /* ── PHOTO COL ── */
  .photo-wrap { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem; }

  .photo-img-wrap {
    position: relative;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(15,23,42,0.15);
    border: 3px solid white;
    outline: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .photo-img {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4/5;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: 60% 58%;
    transform: scale(1.35);
    transform-origin: 60% 60%;
    display: block;
  }
  .photo-location-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 12px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: rgba(15,23,42,0.75);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    color: white;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
  }

  /* KURZPROFIL */
  .quick-profile {
    background: var(--bg-soft);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .qp-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.55rem 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }
  .qp-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .qp-label { color: var(--text-light); font-weight: 500; }
  .qp-val { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; text-align: right; }
  .qp-val--coral { color: var(--coral); }

  .photo-card-ig {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--text-mid);
    padding: 0.65rem 1rem;
    background: var(--bg-soft);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .photo-card-ig a { color: #E1306C; font-weight: 700; }

  /* ── TEXT COL ── */
  .about-name {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .about-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text-mid);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  /* CTA */
  .about-cta { display: flex; gap: 0.65rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 1.75rem; }

  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
    background: var(--coral);
    color: white;
    padding: 0.7rem 1.3rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-family: inherit;
    transition: all 0.15s;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: #EA6D10;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(249,115,22,0.3);
  }
  .btn-secondary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.7rem 1.3rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-family: inherit;
    background: var(--bg-soft);
    color: var(--text);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    transition: all 0.15s;
  }
  .btn-secondary:hover { border-color: #CBD5E1; transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .btn-ig {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.7rem 1.3rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-family: inherit;
    background: transparent;
    color: #E1306C;
    border: 1.5px solid #E1306C;
    transition: all 0.15s;
  }
  .btn-ig:hover { background: #FFF0F5; }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .photo-img { aspect-ratio: 4/3; object-position: 50% 50%; transform: none; }
    .about-body { font-size: 0.95rem; }
    .about-cta { flex-direction: column; margin-top: 1.25rem; }
    .about-cta a { justify-content: center; width: 100%; }
    .about-name { font-size: 1.8rem; }
    .about-wrap { padding: 2rem 1.25rem 3rem; }
    .page-header { padding: 2rem 1.25rem; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 380px) {
    .about-wrap { padding: 1.5rem 1rem 2.5rem; }
    .page-header { padding: 1.5rem 1rem; }
    .about-name { font-size: 1.5rem; }
    .qp-row { padding: .45rem .75rem; font-size: .78rem; }
  }
</style>

<script is:inline>
  (function () {
    var bday = new Date('2005-03-21');
    var today = new Date();
    var age = today.getFullYear() - bday.getFullYear();
    if (today < new Date(today.getFullYear(), bday.getMonth(), bday.getDate())) age--;
    var els = [document.getElementById('about-age'), document.getElementById('about-age-inline')];
    els.forEach(function(el) { if (el) el.textContent = age + (el.id === 'about-age' ? ' Jahre' : ''); });
  })();
</script>
